---
import CookieArt from './CookieArt.astro';
import Icon from './HomeIcon.astro';
---
<dialog class="jc-storage-dialog" data-storage-dialog aria-labelledby="jc-storage-title"><div class="jc-storage-dialog-top"><CookieArt/><button type="button" data-storage-close aria-label="Close storage information"><Icon name="close" size={20}/></button></div><p class="support-kicker">YOUR CREATIVE SPACE</p><h2 id="jc-storage-title">Cookies &amp; storage</h2><p>JotColoring uses essential security storage and saves your artwork when you choose. We do not add audience analytics or load a third-party advertising script.</p><p>The labeled sponsored banner is part of this page. It does not need an advertising-cookie choice or an age declaration. Only clicking its external link opens the advertising provider's website, where that site's privacy rules apply.</p><p>Your artwork, photos, notes, favorites and age are not included in the sponsored link. Use <a href="/cookies/">Cookies &amp; storage</a> and <a href="/privacy/#advertising">Privacy</a> for details. Back up saved artwork before clearing browser storage.</p><button type="button" class="support-button secondary" data-storage-close>Close</button></dialog>
<script>import {mountStorageNotice} from '../privacy/controller';mountStorageNotice();</script>
